 "notes": "Entity y = feet cell; ground top is row 10. No kids as enemies: one harmless scooter kid on the drive (harmless:true, hitbox:false, no damage/knock-back; hop over it for a small coin bonus). Main path climbs external stairs onto the two-storey Block A/B roofs (rooftop arena on Block B) and jumps the 3-wide courtyard light-well; dropping in is optional (yarn) and escapable by wall jump or the drainpipe. Covered court roof, playground decks, goalpost crossbar, bush branches are the cat route. Fliers (magpie, wasp) only under open sky."
